  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LEV 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ebisusuro ase ogotaigwera",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene agateebia Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kwana n’Abaisraeli, obateebie: Monto onde bwensi oino, gose omomenyi omenyete ase egati yaino, orarue omwana onde oye ase enyasae Moleki, goika aitwe akwe. Omoganda oino bwonsi omoake amagena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inche omonyene nimbe nendamwamu ase omonto oyio, ekiagera orure omwana onde oye ase enyasae Moleki. Nimwatanane korwa ase abanto baye, ekiagera ogerire Obomenyo bwane Obochenu bobe obotachenegeti, na orenteire erieta riane richenu obosooku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye abanto b’ense yaino bakoombia, tibaita omonto oyio orure oyomo bw’abana baye ase enyasae Moleki,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "erio inche omonyene nimbe nendamwamu ase omonto oyio na eamate yaye. Nimwatanane amo nabaanto bonsi bamobwatirie, ekiagera bakoonchokera enyasae eria Moleki, ase okoyesasiima, bakaba abatari abegenwa ase ’nde; nimbasirie korwa ase abanto baye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Onye omonto okorigia ogosemigwa korwa ase abanto bakoboria amang’ana korwa ase emeika y’abanto bakwete, gose kogenda ase abarogi, taba omwegenwa ase ’nde, korende abe ogosasiima emeika eyio, inche nimbe nendamwamu ase omonto oyio, na imwatanane korwa ase abanto baye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eatanane, mwerue mobe abachenu, ekiagera inche ninche Omonene, Nyasae oino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mobwate amachiiko aane na koyakora; inche ninche Omonene, nkobachena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kera omonto okoragereria ise gose ng’ina, oyio goika akwe. Ekiagera oragereirie ise na ng’ina, okomocha kw’ogoiteka kw’amanyinga aye nigo koraabe okwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Onye omonto ogotomana n’omokuungu bw’omonto onde, abwo babere, omosacha oria amo n’omokuungu oria, goika baitwe bakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye omonto okoraara n’omokuungu ore moga ise, igo orenteire ise obosooku; abwo bonsi babere goika baitwe bakwe. Okomocha kw’ogoiteka kw’amanyinga abo nigo koraabe okwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye omonto okoraara na moka momura oye, abwo bonsi babere goika baitwe bakwe; bakorire okogechia. Okomocha kw’ogoiteka kw’amanyinga abo nigo koraabe okwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye omosacha okoraara nomosaacha onde buna akoraara n’omokuungu, abwo bonsi babere bakorire okogechia okobe; goika baitwe bakwe, na okomocha kw’ogoiteka kw’amanyinga abo nigo koraabe okwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye omonto okonyuoma omokungu aire na ng’ina biara abasang’ananie, obwo nobonyaka obobe. Omosacha oria amo nabakungu baria babere basambwe n’omorero bakwe, erinde obonyaka buna obwo tiboba ase egati yaino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye omonto okoraara neng’iti, omonto oyio aitwe akwe, n’eng’iti eyio eitwe ekwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye omokungu ogoika eng’iti ende yonsi ang’e, na koraara nero, omokungu oyio goika aitwe akwe, n’engiti eyio eitwe ekwe. Okomocha kw’ogoiteka kw’amanyinga abo nigo koraabe okwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Onye omonto okoira omoiseke omwabo, oyo o ise gose o ng’ina, nabwo barorane bare getirianda, obwo nobosooku obonene. Barabwo goika baatananwe barusigwe ase amasio y’abanto b’egesaku kiabo. Omonto oyio orenteire omoiseke omwabo obosooku. Obobe bw’ogosaria okwo nigo boraabe igoro y’omonto oyio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye omonto omosacha okoraara n’omokuungu ekero abwate omotienyi, omonto oyio orenteire omokungu oyio obosooku ase okorora ensoko y’amanyinga aye, nere oorokirie ase amanyinga agoiteka korwa; abwo babere baatananwe korwa ase abanto b’egesaku kiabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tobaisa koraara nomoiseke omwabo nyoko, gose omoiseke omwabo iso; obwo nobonyaka obobe, ekiagera abwo nabanyako moke. Obobe bw’ogosaria okwo nigo boraabe igoro yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye omonto okoraara na moga ise moke, omwabo ise, igo orenteire ise moke obosooku. Egesusuro ki’ogosaria kw’ebibe biabo nigo keraabe ekiabo, na barabwo nigo barakwe bataiboreti bana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye omonto okoira moka momura omwabo, okwo nogosaria, ere orenteire momura omwabo obosooku. Barabwo nigo baragombae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ase ayio mobwate amachiiko aane na emeroberio yonsi nabachiikire, na moyakore, erio ense eria ase nkobaira mogochia komenya tebaanga gose tebaseria korwa aroro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timochia kobwatia chingencho chi’abaanto b’egesaku keria ngochia goseria kerue ase amasio aino; barabwo nigo bakorete amang’ana ayio onsi, na ase engencho y’ayio nkagechigwa nabarabwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende inabarierete inwe eira ng’a nimbae ense yabo ebe omwando oino, ense entenenku ere namabeere na amooke. Inche ninche Omonene, Nyasae oino, nabaatananire inwe korwa ase ebisaku binde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe goika momanye gwaatanana ching’iti chichenegete korwa ase echitachenegeti, ne chinyoni chichenegete korwa ase echitachenegeti. Timobaisa gwesoyia ase ogotacheneka ase okoria ching’iti gose chinyoni chitachenegeti, gose timoria ching’iti chinde chionsi chikwagura ase ense, echi naatananire chibe chitachenegeti ase more.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe mobe abachenu baane, ekiagera inche Omonene nigo inde omochenu, nabaatananire korwa ase ebisaku binde, erinde mobe abaane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omosacha, gose omokungu, orarigie ogosemigwa korwa ase emeika y’abanto bakwete, gose oyore omoorogi, goika aitwe akwe. Abanto abwo baakwe amagena bakwe; okomocha kw’ogoiteka kw’amanyinga abo nakobe okwabo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
